{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43280","headline":"济川用舟檝 · 胡权","name":"济川用舟檝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渺渺水连天，归程想几千。\n孤舟辞曲岸，轻檝济长川。\n迥指波涛雪，回瞻岛屿烟。\n心迷沧海上，目断白云边。\n泛滥虽无定，维持且自专。\n还如圣明代，理国用英贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡权","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}